          "filename": "Collared Peccary crossing the road.jpg",
          "caption": "The collared peccary (Peccary angulatus) is the only wild, native pig-like animal in the United States. It is also known as the Javelina, and Musk Hog and skunk pig. The peccary is not a pig. Observed in Sabino Canyon, Arizona",
